  "items": [
   {
    "text": "This dead star spins",
    "start": 19,
    "end": 131
   },
   {
    "text": "161 times every second.",
    "start": 131,
    "end": 267
   },
   {
    "text": "It's a pulsar:",
    "start": 274,
    "end": 334
   },
   {
    "text": "the collapsed core",
    "start": 334,
    "end": 409
   },
   {
    "text": "of a giant star.",
    "start": 409,
    "end": 477
   },
   {
    "text": "More massive than the Sun,",
    "start": 477,
    "end": 585
   },
   {
    "text": "yet only 20 km across.",
    "start": 585,
    "end": 684
   },
   {
    "text": "Its magnetic poles fire",
    "start": 685,
    "end": 767
   },
   {
    "text": "beams of radio waves",
    "start": 767,
    "end": 839
   },
   {
    "text": "that sweep through space",
    "start": 839,
    "end": 925
   },
   {
    "text": "like a lighthouse.",
    "start": 925,
    "end": 997
   },
   {
    "text": "In 1992,",
    "start": 997,
    "end": 1037
   },
   {
    "text": "astronomers found",
    "start": 1037,
    "end": 1116
   },
   {
    "text": "something no one expected:",
    "start": 1116,
    "end": 1235
   },
   {
    "text": "planets orbiting it.",
    "start": 1235,
    "end": 1334
   },
   {
    "text": "The first planets",
    "start": 1339,
    "end": 1400
   },
   {
    "text": "ever confirmed",
    "start": 1400,
    "end": 1451
   },
   {
    "text": "beyond our Solar System.",
    "start": 1451,
    "end": 1544
   },
   {
    "text": "They likely formed",
    "start": 1705,
    "end": 1772
   },
   {
    "text": "in a debris disk,",
    "start": 1772,
    "end": 1835
   },
   {
    "text": "perhaps from a destroyed",
    "start": 1835,
    "end": 1923
   },
   {
    "text": "companion star.",
    "start": 1923,
    "end": 1987
   },
   {
    "text": "Its radiation and particle wind",
    "start": 2017,
    "end": 2138
   },
   {
    "text": "batter them nonstop,",
    "start": 2138,
    "end": 2218
   },
   {
    "text": "and might even light",
    "start": 2218,
    "end": 2298
   },
   {
    "text": "auroras in their skies.",
    "start": 2298,
    "end": 2396
   },
   {
    "text": "Draugr. Poltergeist. Phobetor.",
    "start": 2665,
    "end": 2785
   },
   {
    "text": "Worlds named after",
    "start": 2785,
    "end": 2858
   },
   {
    "text": "the undead and nightmares,",
    "start": 2858,
    "end": 2962
   },
   {
    "text": "circling a star",
